{"id":"en_moth-to-the-anderson","title":"Moth to the Anderson","titleEn":"Moth to the Anderson","description":"Olivia, the feared business tycoon of Langta, crashes a wedding to force Bennett, heir to the Anderson family, to marry her, honoring a promise from their childhood. She imprisons him with her possessive love, met only with his contempt. However, when a conspiracy puts her life in danger, Bennett takes a bullet for her. At the brink of life and death, their roles as the domineering CEO and the captive prey reverse. A tale of redemption and deep affection begins, a classic \"regretful husband chasing his wife\" scenario unfolds.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/moth-to-the-anderson/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/moth-to-the-anderson/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Love After Divorce","Love After Marriage","Romantic Marriage","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz5ns/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_moth-to-the-anderson_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz5ns/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_moth-to-the-anderson_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz5ns/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_moth-to-the-anderson_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz5ns/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_moth-to-the-anderson_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz5ns/?